FEATURE: license-url-github
DATE: 2026-11-09
SCOPE: licence link and project link in every source file's header comment

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
AFFECTED PROJECTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

vUX: comment-only change in 25 source files. No behaviour, API or file-name change,
so consumers (app.myinvitees.com, vilshub.net, vSketch, vGet) are unaffected.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHAT CHANGED
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The header comment's licence URL moved from the old library host
  https://library.vilshub.net/lib/vUX/license
to the LICENSE file in the GitHub repository
  https://github.com/VilsHub/vUX/blob/master/LICENSE

The project link on the line above it moved from
  https://library.vilshub.net/lib/vUX/
to the GitHub repository
  https://github.com/VilsHub/vUX

The CDN import URLs on library.vilshub.net shown in
README.md and CLAUDE.md (http://library.vilshub.net/lib/vUX/<version>/...) were left as
they are: they are module import paths, not links to the project.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
VERIFICATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

grep: 0 old licence or project links left, 25 of each new one. CR line-ending counts per file are
identical before and after (the CRLF files stay CRLF).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
VERSION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Patch-level (comment only). .version already records v4.0.0-beta, a major bump over
the last tag v3.0.0, so it is unchanged.
